--     named after the player in Hooks.CharacterFolder (default: Workspace),
--   * picks a root part from RootPartNames (then PrimaryPart, then the largest part),
--   * picks a head part from HeadPartNames (else tags attach to the root),
--   * sizes the box from the model's real bounding box (BoxFromModel),
